{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659814",
      "title": "Sharing State Across Components",
      "sourceHash": "5f0b97282b742a56c30d9b28334f0144e310c7a0257eb66d4b762b668d139bed",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 2.79,
          "en": "So, did you succeed?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.79,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "Let's implement this together now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 8.643,
          "en": "And for this, I'll start in the Log component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.48,
          "end": 12.48,
          "en": "There, we will definitely need some props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.48,
          "end": 16.71,
          "en": "to get those gameTurns from inside the App component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.71,
          "end": 18.243,
          "en": "into this Log component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.08,
          "end": 22.5,
          "en": "So here, we could expect to get a turns prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.5,
          "end": 24.03,
          "en": "And then, in here, I, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.03,
          "end": 29.03,
          "en": "want to map this turns prop to a list of list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.25,
          "end": 31.17,
          "en": "in this ordered list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.17,
          "end": 33.84,
          "en": "So therefore, here, I'll get my turn data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 33.84,
          "end": 37.77,
          "en": "And this turn data will be mapped to a list item,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.77,
          "end": 42.77,
          "en": "where I want to say which player selected which field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.16,
          "end": 46.29,
          "en": "with the coordinates of that field.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 48.87,
          "en": "So the row and columnIndex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.87,
          "end": 53.87,
          "en": "Now, both pieces of data are stored in this turn here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.88,
          "end": 56.46,
          "en": "Because every turn, as you saw before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.46,
          "end": 60.51,
          "en": "has this square and this player information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.51,
          "end": 62.91,
          "en": "The player information is just the symbol,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 62.91,
          "end": 64.953,
          "en": "but that's good enough for the Log here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.91,
          "end": 68.46000000000001,
          "en": "So therefore, here, we can say turn.player,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.46000000000001,
          "end": 70.28999999999999,
          "en": "which is the symbol.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.28999999999999,
          "end": 71.343,
          "en": "Selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 72.18,
          "end": 73.503,
          "en": "And then, here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 74.7,
          "end": 78.18299999999999,
          "en": "I want to output turn.square.row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.64,
          "end": 83.03999999999999,
          "en": "So this rowIndex number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.03999999999999,
          "end": 84.723,
          "en": "And of course, also the column.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 85.65,
          "end": 87.53999999999999,
          "en": "Maybe separated by a comma,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 87.53999999999999,
          "end": 90.24,
          "en": "which is no special JavaScript character here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 90.24,
          "end": 92.913,
          "en": "but simply a comma that will be output on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 94.14,
          "end": 98.22,
          "en": "And then, here, we can say turn.square.col.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 100.14,
          "en": "And of course, we should add a key here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 100.14,
          "end": 101.78999999999999,
          "en": "because you should always do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 101.78999999999999,
          "end": 104.7,
          "en": "when outputting a dynamic list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 104.7,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "And the key here could be the combination of row and column",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 112.25999999999999,
          "en": "because that will be unique for every turn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 112.25999999999999,
          "end": 115.47,
          "en": "because a given row-column combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.47,
          "end": 118.56,
          "en": "can only be selected once.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 118.56,
          "end": 119.55,
          "en": "I guess, at the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.55,
          "end": 121.95,
          "en": "you can click the same field multiple times,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 121.95,
          "end": 123.87,
          "en": "but that will change soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 123.87,
          "end": 126.78,
          "en": "So this row-column combination can be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 126.78,
          "end": 130.473,
          "en": "to uniquely identify an entry in our log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.3,
          "end": 135.9,
          "en": "So therefore, here, I'll create a string with backticks here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 135.9,
          "end": 140.34,
          "en": "to use JavaScript's template literal syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 140.34,
          "end": 143.97,
          "en": "So this is not a single quote but a backtick.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.97,
          "end": 146.16,
          "en": "And this template literal syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.16,
          "end": 149.85,
          "en": "can be used in JavaScript to create a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.85,
          "end": 154.05,
          "en": "where you can easily inject values into that string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.05,
          "end": 155.61,
          "en": "with this syntax.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.61,
          "end": 159,
          "en": "And that's now JavaScript syntax, not React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159,
          "end": 161.76,
          "en": "Dollar sign, opening and closing curly brace",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 161.76,
          "end": 165,
          "en": "can be used in conjunction with those backticks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165,
          "end": 168.42000000000002,
          "en": "to dynamically construct a string.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.42000000000002,
          "end": 172.29,
          "en": "And the first value I want to inject into this string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.29,
          "end": 174.753,
          "en": "is turn.square.row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.49,
          "end": 179.22,
          "en": "The second value, thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 179.22,
          "end": 181.533,
          "en": "is turn.square.col.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.73,
          "end": 184.95,
          "en": "So that overall, this is a string",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 184.95,
          "end": 188.91,
          "en": "that will simply be the combination of row and columnIndex,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 188.91,
          "end": 192.15,
          "en": "created with this template literal syntax",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.15,
          "end": 194.64,
          "en": "provided by JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.64,
          "end": 196.95,
          "en": "And attached, you'll find a link to learn more",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.95,
          "end": 199.803,
          "en": "about this syntax in case you never heard about it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.76,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "And then here's the actual log message,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 204.513,
          "en": "which I want to show.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.89,
          "end": 207.81,
          "en": "And with that, we just need to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 207.81,
          "end": 210.39,
          "en": "that this turns prop is set here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 210.39,
          "end": 213.78,
          "en": "So in the App component, on the Log component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.78,
          "end": 215.79,
          "en": "we should add the turns prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 215.79,
          "end": 219.06,
          "en": "and pass our gameTurns state snapshot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 219.06,
          "end": 222.813,
          "en": "as a value through that prop to that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.06,
          "end": 228.51,
          "en": "And with that, if you save everything again and you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.51,
          "end": 229.95,
          "en": "if you click a button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.95,
          "end": 232.38,
          "en": "you see a log message appear down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.38,
          "end": 234.9,
          "en": "And you see a new log message is added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.9,
          "end": 238.5,
          "en": "for every square that I select here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.5,
          "end": 242.31,
          "en": "And that's how we can output this log data here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.31,
          "end": 245.34,
          "en": "and how we're now using a single piece of state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 245.34,
          "end": 247.38,
          "en": "this gameTurns state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 250.113,
          "en": "to update two different parts of the UI.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}